# GitHub-only workflow

This project has two remotes historically, but **all day-to-day work uses GitHub only**.

| Remote | URL | Use? |
|--------|-----|------|
| `github` | `https://github.com/faebeanie94/tfg-centering.git` | **Yes — always** |
| `origin` | GitLab | **No** — ignore unless the user explicitly asks |

## Required commands

- Fetch / pull: `git fetch github` / `git pull github <branch>`
- Push: `git push -u github HEAD` (never `origin` by default)
- PRs: `gh pr … --repo faebeanie94/tfg-centering`
- Deploy: Fly app `tfg-centering` (https://tfg-centering.fly.dev) from GitHub `main` via Actions

## Branch naming

Prefer `cursor/<short-description>` for feature branches pushed to GitHub.
